msgctxt "shortcut_settings_hint"
msgid ""
"Select a command, press Tab to Change, then press the new keys. Confirm with"
" OK. Changes take effect when you apply or save Settings. The same key can "
"serve different screens; a new conflicting assignment is refused."
msgstr ""
